ice\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not sold by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Utility Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"usable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Usable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8.20<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">July 2, 2008<br/>Summer Update 2008</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20171107215410&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Spellbook_of_Mind_Control_15eca0.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a spellbook of mind control <span class=\"p-attributes\">(Def:26, magic level +2)</span>.<div class=\"p-reqs\">It can only be wielded properly by sorcerers and druids of level 50 or higher.<br/></div><div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 24.50 oz.</div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">It shows your spells and can also shield against attacks when worn.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>This item used to be really rare because it was only dropped by <a href=\"#/wiki/Yaga%20the%20Crone\">Yaga the Crone</a>. After Winter Update 2008, you can also loot it from many other strong <a href=\"#/wiki/Creatures\">creatures</a>. Be aware if you've hunted with a normal shield that you will take extra damage.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-object-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<ul><li>As announced on June 16, 2026, the Vocation Adjustments Update 2026 raised its defense from 16 to 26</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Blood%20Priest\">Blood Priest</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Brachiodemon\">Brachiodemon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bulltaur%20Forgepriest\">Bulltaur Forgepriest</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Carnivostrich\">Carnivostrich</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Choking%20Fear\">Choking Fear</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Court%20Warlock\">Court Warlock</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Crypt%20Mage\">Crypt Mage</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dawnfire%20Asura\">Dawnfire Asura</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ferumbras\">Ferumbras</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ferumbras%20Mortal%20Sh